Maretha WebUI includes Nuxeo icon geometry, scalar theme values and selected interface labels derived from Nuxeo Elements and Nuxeo Web UI, and contribution filter semantics ported from Nuxeo Elements ui/nuxeo-filter.js and ui/nuxeo-filters-behavior.js.

