Source repositories: https://github.com/nuxeo/nuxeo-elements and https://github.com/nuxeo/nuxeo-web-ui.
Pinned revisions and extraction details are in polymer-assets.provenance.json.

Changes: converted source SVG groups, scalar theme declarations and selected labels into typed Angular data catalogs; repaired the missing closing tag of the unretain path without changing its geometry. Reimplemented the filter conditions and FiltersBehavior helpers as pure TypeScript functions; string expressions became typed predicates. Runtime registries, safe SVG rendering and Angular adapters are Maretha implementation.

